            "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
            "params": {
              "text": "<h2><strong>Cloudberries</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Cloudberries grow in alpine and arctic tundra.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>The cloudberry is also known as bakeapple, knotberry and averin, and is part of the Rose family.&nbsp;</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Each fruit is initially pale red, ripening into an amber color in early autumn.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Scandinavia has strict rules for harvesting cloudberries. Sweden even has a section for regulating this in their Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n"
            },
